    69	- On success, create a private playlist (default name from the group chat's title, e.g. *"🎵 <Chat Name>"*, renameable) and store the refresh token in the Keychain.
    70	
    71	**4. Import (backfill).**
    72	- A progress screen runs the one-time historical import: *"Scanning 4,213 messages… found 87 Spotify links… adding 74 new tracks to the playlist…"* (deduped count shown).
